
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>Arctic</title>

<style>
@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;600;800&display=swap');

*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}

body{
    font-family:Inter,sans-serif;
    background:#eef8ff;
    color:#08263a;
}

nav{
    padding:25px 6%;
    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-between;
}

.logo{font-weight:800}

nav a{
    margin-left:25px;
    color:#587487;
    text-decoration:none;
}

.hero{
    text-align:center;
    padding:130px 20px;
}

.hero small{
    color:#1989c7;
    letter-spacing:3px;
}

h1{
    font-size:clamp(55px,10vw,120px);
    letter-spacing:-6px;
    margin:25px 0;
}

h1 span{color:#38bdf8}

.hero p{
    max-width:600px;
    margin:auto;
    color:#638093;
    line-height:1.8;
}

.cards{
    max-width:1100px;
    margin:auto;
    padding:0 5% 100px;
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);
    gap:20px;
}

.card{
    padding:40px;
    border:1px solid #c9e7f7;
    background:rgba(255,255,255,.7);
    border-radius:25px;
}

.card h2{margin-bottom:15px}

.card p{
    color:#668093;
    line-height:1.7;
}

footer{
    text-align:center;
    padding:30px;
    color:#7891a1;
}

@media(max-width:650px){
    .cards{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    nav div:last-child{display:none}
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<nav>
<div class="logo">ARCTIC°</div>
<div>
<a href="#">Projects</a>
<a href="#">About</a>
</div>
</nav>

<section class="hero">
<small>CREATIVE TECHNOLOGY</small>
<h1>Cold. Clean.<br><span>Precise.</span></h1>
<p>
A minimalist digital studio creating interfaces
with precision, speed and clarity.
</p>
</section>

<section class="cards">

<div class="card">
<h2>01 — Interfaces</h2>
<p>Clean systems designed to make complicated products feel simple.</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h2>02 — Websites</h2>
<p>Fast responsive websites that work beautifully on every screen.</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h2>03 — Motion</h2>
<p>Subtle animation that gives digital products personality.</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h2>04 — Systems</h2>
<p>Scalable design systems built for growing teams.</p>
</div>

</section>

<footer>© 2026 CWS</footer>

</body>
</html>

